IRC Fiber channel rules — https://ircfiber.com

1. Be respectful to other users.
2. No spam, flooding, or abuse.
3. No harassment, hate speech, or threats.
4. Keep channels on topic; take disputes to staff.
5. No unsolicited advertising or mass messaging.
6. No illegal content or activity.
7. Respect channel modes and staff decisions.
8. One account per person; no ban evasion.
9. Bots and scripts must not flood; ask staff first.
10. Operator instructions are final; appeal in #support.
